The files in this directory were copied unchanged from the commit above
(LICENSE from the repository root). Changes made for this project, which
turn ZAP into a functional model of the TI ARM925T (ARMv4T) used in Nokia's
UPP_WD2 ASIC, are marked in the source with the tag "ARM925T:" and are
described in docs/CPU.md. The upstream behaviour stays the default of each
new parameter where that is possible; rtl/cpu/arm925t.sv sets the ARM925T
values. Bug fixes that apply in every configuration are listed in
docs/CPU.md as well.

rtl/cpu/arm925t_gen.v is generated from these files by tools/gen_cpu.sh
(sv2v and the fixes Quartus 17 needs); it is a derived work under the same
licence.
